{"term":{"label":"德","occurrences":4,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"4A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i","title":"離婁上","description":"孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"今","id":"今"},{"form":"何","id":"何"},{"form":"受","id":"受"},{"form":"命","id":"命"},{"form":"國","id":"國"},{"form":"大","id":"大"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"守","id":"守"},{"form":"小","id":"小"},{"form":"師","id":"師"},{"form":"年","id":"年"},{"form":"德","id":"德"},{"form":"必","id":"必"},{"form":"悅","id":"悅"},{"form":"教","id":"敎"},{"form":"正","id":"正"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.0794415416798357,"source":"年","target":"國"},{"weight":1.2431935174792172,"source":"年","target":"大"},{"weight":2.159484249353372,"source":"年","target":"小"},{"weight":2.005333569526114,"source":"年","target":"今"},{"weight":2.005333569526114,"source":"年","target":"必"},{"weight":1.0200499661650075,"source":"悅","target":"大"},{"weight":1.9363406980391626,"source":"守","target":"大"},{"weight":3.0349529867072724,"source":"命","target":"受"},{"weight":1.5998684614179497,"source":"命","target":"今"},{"weight":0.9808292530117262,"source":"命","target":"國"},{"weight":0.8377284093710529,"source":"命","target":"大"},{"weight":1.754019141245208,"source":"命","target":"小"},{"weight":2.629487878599108,"source":"命","target":"師"},{"weight":0.8266785731844679,"source":"必","target":"國"},{"weight":1.7821900182119044,"source":"必","target":"敎"},{"weight":1.3121863889661687,"source":"必","target":"正"},{"weight":1.7821900182119044,"source":"今","target":"受"},{"weight":0.8266785731844679,"source":"今","target":"國"},{"weight":0.6835777295437946,"source":"今","target":"大"},{"weight":1.5998684614179497,"source":"今","target":"小"},{"weight":1.7821900182119044,"source":"今","target":"師"},{"weight":3.0349529867072724,"source":"敎","target":"德"},{"weight":2.341805806147327,"source":